  "note": "Gym idiom (like a1_case_gym / a1_present_gym): ZERO new material. Only forms taught in a2_past_byc, a2_past_ac and a2_past_rest — 14 verbs, singular only, both genders, imperfective only. Drills the two live confusions: gender (byłem/byłam, robił/robiła) and person (byłem/byłeś). Situational wczoraj cues rather than announced tense. Cues English-only, Polish lives in frames and answers (the a1_case_gym smoke-test correction). Match board shows the whole seven-slot form system rather than all 14 verbs — 12 rows will not hold both. Every demanded form was checked against the teaches_lemmas of the three support packs; the pack demands nothing they do not tag. Structure IDs past_ac / past_rest are taken from those packs — the orchestrator still has to register them in the catalogue.",
